Subject: [PATCH] hw/input: model A133 LRADC volume rocker

Replace the release guest's inert LRADC aperture with a driver-shaped
model and expose its two volume buttons through PocketForge input ABI 2.4.
Keep the disabled producer guest inert while covering registers, IRQs,
validation, reset, migration, and the additive query response.

Assisted-by: LLM
